# Exam track — Theme: Hobbien & Fräizäit — Sub-lesson 1: Vocabulary
# Sproochentest oral-exam topic. Target level ~B1 (authoring guideline only).
#
# Every sub-lesson mixes words AND sentences so each session alternates
# word-match and sentence-builder slots; the emphasis here is vocabulary.

@lesson H1.01 "Hobbies Vocabulary"

@word den Hobby = the hobby
@word d'Fräizäit = the free time
@word d'Aktivitéit = the activity
@word kreativ = creative
@word spannend = exciting
@word interessant = interesting
@word molen = to paint
@word sangen = to sing
@word lauschteren = to listen
@word d'Musek = the music
@word liesen = to read
@word d'Bicher = the books
@word interesséieren = to interest

@sentence
@lu A menger Fräizäit lauschteren ech gär Musek.
@en In my free time I like listening to music.
@distractor-lu kucken
@distractor-lu sangen
@distractor-en watching
@distractor-en singing

@sentence
@lu Ech molen a sange gär.
@en I like painting and singing.
@distractor-lu liesen
@distractor-lu lauschteren
@distractor-en reading
@distractor-en listening

@sentence
@lu Ech liese gär Bicher, well si mech interesséieren.
@en I like reading books, because they interest me.
@distractor-lu kaschten
@distractor-lu molen
@distractor-en cost
@distractor-en paint

@sentence
@lu Wann ech Zäit hunn, molen ech gär.
@en When I have time, I like painting.
@distractor-lu sangen
@distractor-lu lauschteren
@distractor-en sing
@distractor-en listen
